            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The department head is charged with the responsibility of seeing that vacation is taken in order that the employee does not lose vacation credits. Each employee shall receive annually on or before April 1, as of March 1, a preliminary statement of the available vacation credits from the local office. A central office statement shall be forthcoming to each work location by April 30 for dissemination to each employee.",
